-    - "All nine component-architecture features (AM-F001 through AM-F009) are mandatory — never excludable for any Garura-based product."
-    - "Every play is a compiled artifact traceable to an intent file — direct edits to compiled play files are forbidden."
-    - "100% of domain tasks inside a play are delegated to agents — inlining domain logic in plays is forbidden."
