-    - "A regression test is mandatory on every fix — no fix-first-test-later; the regression test is required before the fix-it play marks the defect closed."
-    - "The 5-whys structure in the root-cause-analysis template — the fix-it play enforces root-cause-analysis depth before proposing any fix; a shallow analysis is a blocking failure."
-  kb_source:
-    capability: "WI-F010"
-    rules_applied:
-      - "WI-F010 mandatory-conditional — any L3 and above play; every play has step evaluations generated from its intent file."
-      - "WI-F011 mandatory-conditional — test automation exists; synthesized tests trace to scenarios."
-      - "WI-F012 mandatory-conditional — production systems; every defect has root-cause-analysis evidence."
-      - "WI-F013 mandatory-default — never excludable; fix-it loop closure required for every defect."
-      - "5-whys root-cause-analysis structure enforced by the fix-it play before fix proposal."
-      - "Mandatory regression test — no fix without a regression test linked in short-term memory."
-    experiential_warnings:
-      - "Fixing the symptom before completing root-cause-analysis — the fix-it play is designed to block this."
-      - "Ambiguous scenario authoring that produces passing-but-wrong synthesized tests."
-      - "Skipping root-cause-analysis for quick fixes — quick fixes without root-cause-analysis are the primary source of reopened defects."
