-### Intent → Skill Mapping
-
-| Intent Pattern | Example | Skill | Why |
-|----------------|---------|-------|-----|
-| "configure capabilities", "select capabilities", "apply cross-tree constraints" | "Configure capabilities for this healthcare B2B product with HIPAA + high security" | `derive-capability-selection` | Structured selection from the KB catalog with explicit constraint walking |
